.gsd/milestones/M005/slices/S05/S05-PLAN.md:12:- `apps/mobile/src/lib/offline/transport.ts` adds a bounded recurrence-suggestion loader that mirrors the web query contract: same `calendarId`, trailing 30-day lookback ending at `visibleWeek.endAt`, sorted rows, and fail-closed `null` on timeout/query/malformed data.
